          "description": "durations[i] 是第 i 个区间的持续时间。",
          "unit": "T"
        },
        {
          "name": "inflows",
          "type": "list[float]",
          "description": "inflows[i] 是第 i 个区间的流入速率。",
          "unit": "U/T"
        },
        {
          "name": "outflows",
          "type": "list[float]",
          "description": "outflows[i] 是第 i 个区间的流出速率。",
          "unit": "U/T"
        }
      ],
      "returns": [
        {
          "name": "amounts",
          "type": "list[float]",
          "description": "按时间顺序返回物质量；第一项为 A0，后续每项为一个区间末的物质量。",
          "unit": "U"
        }
      ],
      "constraints": [
        "1 ≤ len(durations) = len(inflows) = len(outflows) ≤ 1000。",
        "A0、inflows[i]、outflows[i] 都在 0 到 1000 之间；0 < durations[i] ≤ 100。",
        "返回列表长度为 len(durations)+1，必须包含初值（initial condition）。即使计算结果为负也照实返回，不截成零；负值提醒我们重新检查流出假设。"
      ]
    },
    {
